# M6 evidence — pager 集成恢复（2026-11-25）

## 命令

```bash
make -C micro BOOT_MODULES=capability user initrd
timeout 55s make -C micro run BOOT_MODULES=capability QEMU_TIMEOUT=60s 2>&1 \
  | strings | rg '\[vm\]|\[fault\]|\[heaptest\]'
make -C micro check BOOT_MODULES=capability
```

## 观测

```
[vm] serving in U-mode
[heaptest] probing unmapped page
[fault] va=0000000040020000 access=0000000000000003 -> pager request
[vm] map ok
[fault] resumed
[heaptest] store ok
```

`make check`（capability）：PASS。

## 恢复项

- Makefile：`pager.c`、initrd 8 成员（vm + heaptest）
- `ep_deliver_recv`、`TAG_VM_FAULT`、`ABI_VM_MAP`/`ABI_PAGER_DONE`/`ABI_PID_SELF`
- `service_boot`：`SERVICE_SID_VM` + `pager_init`
- `kernel_init`：内核 spawn vm/heaptest
- `shared/demo.c`：resident U-mode 缺页 → pager

